# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The form links, in the clear.
#
# The site's 301 Google Forms links exist in exactly two places now: encrypted
# in assets/data/unlock.json, which is committed and published, and in plain
# text in the two files below, which are neither. This repository is public and
# GitHub Pages serves it whole, so a plain link committed here would be a plain
# link on the internet — and the password on the front of the site would be
# protecting a door with no wall around it.
#
#   forms.json            the teacher's export, the source of everything
#   links.generated.json  what build-data.mjs hands to build-lock.mjs
#
# Keep a backup of forms.json somewhere off this machine. If it is ever lost,
# lock-admin.html can export the links back out of the encrypted file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/source/forms.json
data/source/links.generated.json
